      "text": "\u2022 Pace Strategy: Minetti (2002) Energy Cost Curve,\n  Altitude (>1500m) & Live Heat Degradation Splits\n\u2022 Goal Determiner: ITRA Terrain Inversion, Asymmetric\n  A/B/C Goals, DUV Ultramarathon Rank Transfer\n\u2022 Gear Finder: 100% Full-Catalog Grounded Trail Shoes\n\u2022 Nutrition Lab: Dynamic 60-90g/h Carb & Sodium Plan\n\u2022 Continuous KB Distillation: NotebookLM Sweeps +\n  Evoke Endurance Podcast YouTube Transcript Crawler",
